1
00:00:00,354 --> 00:00:04,684
(Howard:)What was I supposed to talk about?
We were eating at Johnny Rockets.

2
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:09,350
(Bernadette:)Just saying people
are getting a little tired of it.

3
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:15,370
(Howard:)So I did this amazing thing
and I'm never allowed to mention it?

4
00:00:15,569 --> 00:00:21,099
(Bernadette:)Of course you can. But, maybe a good rule
would be to wait for people to bring it up.

5
00:00:22,776 --> 00:00:26,406
Okay, heh. No problem.
It won't happen again.

6
00:00:27,214 --> 00:00:29,644
- I love you.
- I love you too.

7
00:00:32,319 --> 00:00:35,119
(Howard:)I can't tell you how many times...

8
00:00:35,322 --> 00:00:37,152
(Howard:)...I dreamed I was in bed here...

9
00:00:37,391 --> 00:00:39,421
(Howard:)...with you when I was...

10
00:00:40,094 --> 00:00:41,324
(Raj:)You know...

11
00:00:44,164 --> 00:00:46,064
(Howard:)What, I can't even point?

12
00:00:52,339 --> 00:00:56,439
(Leonard:)So, basically,
this is what's called mag-lev technology.

13
00:00:56,643 --> 00:01:02,023
It uses powerful electromagnets to create
a force strong enough to overcome gravity.

